<item><title>Mondlane tells court “take power” was meant to mobilise public</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mondlane-tells-court-take-power-was-meant-to-mobilise-public-0a4d84/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mondlane-tells-court-take-power-was-meant-to-mobilise-public-0a4d84/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The Mozambican politician said the phrase referred to popular power and people’s ability to influence decisions.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:51:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
