<item><title>Mozambique starts mobile eye clinic to reach 7,000 rural people</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-starts-mobile-eye-clinic-to-reach-7-000-rural-b7adc4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-starts-mobile-eye-clinic-to-reach-7-000-rural-b7adc4/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The health ministry and the Mohamed bin Zayed Foundation for Humanity will run the clinic across five provinces over six months.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:40:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mozambique&apos;s only active cashew factory, in Macia, faces threat to 600 jobs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-only-active-cashew-factory-in-macia-faces-d528a7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-only-active-cashew-factory-in-macia-faces-d528a7/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>Of the 16 cashew-processing plants that once ran in Mozambique, only the Macia factory in Gaza province is still operating, and it is in serious trouble.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:37:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-only-active-cashew-factory-in-macia-faces-d528a7/share.jpg" length="43618" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-only-active-cashew-factory-in-macia-faces-d528a7/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
